{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kellner","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":"WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Five fifths — C→G, G→D, D→A, A→E, and B→F♯ — are each narrowed by ⅕ of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Pythagorean comma, equal to ⁵√(2¹⁴\/3⁷) ≈ 697.654 cents. The remaining seven"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fifths are pure (3:2). The circle closes exactly."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Proposed by Kellner as a reconstruction of Bach’s own tuning, published in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Das Musikinstrument"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" 26 (1977). The choice of five fifths and their positions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mirrors the structure of Werckmeister III while spreading the tempering more evenly."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WellTemperament"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10IvorTuning0B6SystemPA2A15WellTemperamentVRszrlE7kellnerAEvpZ::SYNTHESIZED::s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","symbolKind":"property","title":"kellner","roleHeading":"Type Property","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"kellner","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":"WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"extendedModule":"IvorTuning","modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}]},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament\/kellner"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Kellner (Herbert Anton Kellner, 1977).","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/kellner"},"references":{"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/WellTemperament":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tuning system in which all twelve keys are usable but have distinct tonal characters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"achieved by distributing the Pythagorean comma unevenly around the circle of fifths."}],"title":"WellTemperament"},"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning":{"abstract":[{"text":"Musical pitch, interval, and tuning system types.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning","title":"IvorTuning","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/WellTemperament/kellner":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/kellner","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Kellner (Herbert Anton Kellner, 1977)."}],"title":"kellner","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"kellner"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":"WellTemperament"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WellTemperament"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament\/kellner"}}}